{
  "schema": 2,
  "name": "base",
  "title": "Home base: mine and deliver",
  "description": "The home base, as the first piece of the game loop. Gunship 3 sits on the landing pad of a 60 m base asteroid with its own gravity (about 2 m/s² at the surface, against the ship's 12.8 m/s²). On the plateau: an egg-cup collector, a control tower and a dome. Three rubble asteroids, each with a gold piece and larger fragments, circle the base on slow orbits. Shoot pieces off, tow them home on the tractor's 15 m tether, and bring them near the collector: it takes them on its own, much softer tether and reels them into the cup, where they are captured and counted as delivered. Bases, recipes and ship upgrades come later.",
